# ============================================================================
# PRIVATE — never upload to the fork.  Only generalized CODE belongs on git;
# personal write-ups, internal coordination, and anything carrying a username
# or HOME path stays local.  Organized by category.
# ============================================================================

# -- personal knowledge base / books / reports --
BOOKLET-CAP.md
*-BOOKLET.md
*_REPORT.md
*_REPORT.txt
*_REPORT.pdf

# -- internal agent coordination + handoffs --
COORD.md
COORD-*.md
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
.anthropic/

# -- proposals / plans / design notes (keep the CODE, not the write-ups) --
provenance-b/*.md
*_PROPOSAL.md
*_PLAN.md
*_DESIGN.md

# -- grid audits + inventories: contain cluster username + HOME paths --
